# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
**/.dart_tool/
build/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# Node.js
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
# ...except the MCP server's. That package is an application, not a published
# library, and npm's convention is that an application commits its lockfile so
# installs are reproducible. CI runs `npm ci`, which requires it.
!packages/self_test_mcp/package-lock.json

# Codex task specs: orchestration scaffolding, not shipped source.
.tasks/
